{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1202438-mist-powers","id":1202438,"title":"Mist Powers?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-02T21:26:45-07:00","id":1202438,"title":"Mist Powers?","content":"My best friend and I are rebooting our MtA 2e chronicle. I want to play a Mist Mage this time. Here's the thing, we're throwing out Paths except for the Orders, so we are able to pick any two Ruling Arcanum we want for our characters. We're trying to figure out how to pick the right Arcanum for using Mists, even with Creative Thaumaturgy. So far, it seems that Matter deals with Air and Water, which obviously should have Mist. Force has Weather Control, which should let me use Mist as well. I want to be able to cast Mist powers (something like in the Mistborn novels) and summon horrific Mist creatures. But I have no idea if Spirit, Goetia, and Ghost have Mist ones. Golem spell from Matter seems to be only solid, but I'm hoping there's something similar for a Mist Golem instead and use Matter/Life to make it come to life. Anyone has any better ideas?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22337-overcastghost","name":"OvercastGhost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar22337_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T21:50:24-07:00","id":1202444,"title":"","content":"I suppose you could use Spirit to \u2018cheat\u2019 and have mist spirits tag along with you. The problem is then finding mist spirits in the first place, and having a source of mist or hanging around only in pre-existing mist-prone conditions. Matter/Forces will help with this problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T00:58:15-07:00","id":1202483,"title":"","content":"There isn\u2019t any reason that you shouldn\u2019t be able to animate mist with a spell similar to Golem in the Matter arcana, but without further spells it won\u2019t be solid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T01:02:53-07:00","id":1202485,"title":"","content":"I think your question is hard to answer within the confines of Mage, because of two reasons:<br /> <br /> First it depends, to some degree, on what you want your Mist powers to <i>do</i>. Using water vapor for defense or stealth is probably Matter. Summoning up a mist over an area sounds like Forces. Making your enemies get lost in a misty location might be Space. Spirits, Goetia and Ghosts almost certainly <i>all</i> have Mist-related creatures. I mean, the Temenos Realm of Silent Hill probably has all the mist you'll ever need. :P<br /> <br /> Second, most Arcana have a way to replicate the feats of other Arcana (such as Mutapa's Mages being able to make rain with just about any Arcanum). Fate might well be able to give a location the destiny of becoming misty, for example.<br /> <br /> If I were you, I'd go with Matter to do mist control, then Mind or somesuch to either summon mist creatures of create them wholesale with a Matter/Mind spell (presumably requiring Mastery).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23896-mirthless","name":"Mirthless","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T06:43:41-07:00","id":1202541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mirthless</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1202438-mist-powers?p=1202485#post1202485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I were you, I'd go with Matter to do mist control, then Mind or somesuch to either summon mist creatures of create them wholesale with a Matter/Mind spell (presumably requiring Mastery).</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Spirit would be more appropriate than Mind. Also, it wouldn\u2019t require Mastery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T06:55:50-07:00","id":1202546,"title":"","content":"I was modeling it on the Golem spell, which would require Mastery of Mind to grant it appropriate sentience. Though I suppose that would be the creation, rather than summoning, of a mist monster. Spirit, upon re-reading would work just as well if all you want is a controlling intelligence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23896-mirthless","name":"Mirthless","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T07:11:06-07:00","id":1202555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mirthless</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1202438-mist-powers?p=1202546#post1202546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was modeling it on the Golem spell, which would require Mastery of Mind to grant it appropriate sentience. Though I suppose that would be the creation, rather than summoning, of a mist monster. Spirit, upon re-reading would work just as well if all you want is a controlling intelligence.</div> </div> </div> </div>You only need Mind 5 if you\u2019re creating a new custom built mind to stick in there, a regular goetia would also be only Mind 4. I\u2019m not sure what you mean by \u201cappropriate sentience\u201d though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-04T08:32:23-07:00","id":1224706,"title":"","content":"One way to go about it is to use a play on words: In Chinese, \u201cMist Blade\u201d is pronounced \u201cw\u00f9 d\u0101o,\u201d almost exactly as the pronunciation of Dao enlightenment, which is \u201cw\u00f9 d\u00e0o\u201d. So you could have a Thrysus with a custom legacy of Mind that seeks to imprint his &quot;enlightened mind&quot; into the land and mist, becoming a master of whatever domain he inhabits and &quot;taking it away from the Exarch's tyranny&quot;. Naturally, there is plenty of room for hubris.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}